C:\TORMENT\TRIOCTAGON_new\wt-ntc-pub01\papers\PAPER_G\repository_publication\v0.1.1\PUBLICATION_DISPOSITION.md:15:The mathematical distinctions remain: M1 exact algebra, certified local M2 flip, separate repaired M3 capture at exact lambda_c+1/200 with squared entrance norm three and sufficient entry N=301, and numerical illustrations. M2-to-M3 continuation remains unproved. There is no physical magnetic-field validation, binary64 equivalence theorem, M4 or X01 adoption.
C:\TORMENT\TRIOCTAGON_new\wt-ntc-pub01\papers\PAPER_G\repository_publication\v0.1.1\PAPER_G_INDEX_BEFORE_PUBLICATION.md:12:The v0.1.1 revision removes notation collisions, clarifies terminology, adds a short Conclusion and hardens bibliography metadata. Mathematical equations, claims, evidence inputs and figures are preserved. M3 retains N=301 and the entrance with squared norm three; M2-to-M3 branch continuation remains unproved.
